---
import GoatCounter from '../../components/GoatCounter.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
const project = 'https://bryce-c-au.github.io/gis-carto-sandbox/corridor-xray/project.geolibre.json';
const app = 'https://web.geolibre.app/?url=' + encodeURIComponent(project);
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><title>Corridor X-Ray AU | Geospatial Sandbox</title><meta name="description" content="Explore an alignment using GeoLibre and Queensland spatial data."/><GoatCounter/></head><body>
<header><a href={base + '/'}>← Portfolio</a><span>QUEENSLAND · CORRIDOR SCREENING</span></header><main>
<section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">GEOLIBRE · INTERACTIVE GIS</p><h1>Corridor <em>X-Ray AU</em></h1><p>Explore a route, trace its chainage and identify mapped crossings and constraints with Queensland open data.</p></section>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="GeoLibre corridor workspace"><div class="bar"><div><strong>GEO​LIBRE WORKSPACE</strong><span> Allow the Corridor X-Ray AU plugin when prompted.</span></div><a href={app} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open full screen ↗</a></div><iframe src={app} title="GeoLibre workspace with Corridor X-Ray AU" allow="fullscreen" loading="lazy"></iframe></section>
<section class="guide"><div><p class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</p><h2>From line to insight.</h2></div><div><ol><li>When prompted, trust and load the Corridor X-Ray AU plugin from this portfolio. If it doesn’t open, use the fallback instructions below.</li><li>Draw a line with GeoEditor or add a GeoJSON alignment using <b>Add data → Vector layer</b>. For a first try, download the <a href={base + '/corridor-xray/samples/corridor.geojson'} download>sample alignment</a>.</li><li>In Corridor X-Ray AU, select the alignment, set a buffer, then choose <b>Load QLD pack</b> and <b>Run X-Ray</b>.</li><li>Inspect events and chainage, and export the results as CSV or GeoJSON.</li></ol><details><summary>Plugin didn’t load?</summary><p>Open <b>Settings → Manage plugins → Settings</b> in GeoLibre. Under Manifest URLs, enter the address below and choose Add; then activate Corridor X-Ray AU under <b>Plugins → Installed</b>.</p><code>https://bryce-c-au.github.io/gis-carto-sandbox/corridor-xray/plugin/plugin.json</code><p>Alternatively, download the <a href={base + '/corridor-xray/corridor-xray-au-0.3.0.zip'} download>plugin ZIP</a> and install it using <b>Choose .zip…</b>.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="notes"><h2>About the data</h2><p>The Queensland pack queries Queensland Government roads, watercourses and protected-area services. Elevation uses available GeoLibre terrain or, if enabled, Open-Meteo’s GLO-90 service. Data and services can change or be unavailable; online elevation sends sample coordinates to the service. The assessment uses local metric approximations and is intended for early screening, not engineering design or statutory assessment.</p><p>Powered by <a href="https://geolibre.app/">GeoLibre</a>. Check the plugin’s Sources &amp; provenance panel for data details and limitations.</p></section>
</main><style>:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){margin:0;background:#101719;color:#f0eadd;font-family:Inter,Arial,sans-serif}:global(a){color:#eac18f}header{height:72px;padding:0 5vw;border-bottom:1px solid #3a4846;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;color:#aab5ae;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.15em}header a{font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:0;text-decoration:none}main{max-width:1600px;margin:auto;padding:0 5vw 80px}.intro{padding:55px 0 38px}.eyebrow{color:#d5a873;font-weight:700;font-size:.82rem;letter-spacing:.17em}h1{font:400 clamp(3.2rem,7vw,7rem)/.95 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:18px 0}h1 em{color:#dca66e;font-weight:400}.intro>p:last-child{color:#bdc8c0;line-height:1.6;max-width:650px;font-size:1.1rem}.workspace{border:1px solid #45514c;background:#182223}.bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:18px 20px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.9rem}.bar strong{letter-spacing:.1em}.bar span{color:#bdc8c0}.workspace iframe{display:block;width:100%;height:760px;border:0;background:#eef1ed}.guide{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.3fr;gap:7vw;padding:75px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #3a4846}h2{font:400 clamp(2.2rem,4vw,4rem)/1.05 Georgia,serif;margin:12px 0}.guide li,.guide p,.notes p{color:#bdc8c0;line-height:1.7}.guide li{padding:0 0 12px 8px}details{background:#1b2929;padding:18px;margin-top:24px}summary{cursor:pointer;color:#f0d0a8}code{display:block;overflow-wrap:anywhere;color:#f0d0a8;font-size:.85rem}.notes{max-width:950px;padding-top:50px}.notes h2{font-size:2.5rem}@media(max-width:800px){header{padding:0 20px}header span{display:none}main{padding:0 20px 60px}.guide{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:10px;padding:50px 0}.workspace iframe{height:75vh;min-height:560px}}</style></body></html>
